{"applicability_conditions":"用于验证晶粒尺寸预测模型准确性时，对预测值与实验值进行的相关性分析（未给出更多限定条件）。","identity":{"block_id":"b0077","equation_id":"equation_013","equation_number":"13","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nR = \\frac {\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} \\left(M _ {i} - \\overline {{M}}\\right) \\left(N _ {i} - \\overline {{N}}\\right)}{\\sqrt {\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} \\left(M _ {i} - \\overline {{M}}\\right) ^ {2}} \\sqrt {\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} \\left(N _ {i} - \\overline {{N}}\\right) ^ {2}}}\\tag{13}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.jmrt.2021.08.079"},"latex":"R = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\left(M_{i}-\\overline{M}\\right)\\left(N_{i}-\\overline{N}\\right)}{\\sqrt{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\left(M_{i}-\\overline{M}\\right)^{2}}\\sqrt{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\left(N_{i}-\\overline{N}\\right)^{2}}}","purpose":"计算相关系数 R，用于表征预测值与实验值之间的线性关系，以评估晶粒尺寸预测模型的准确性。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"相关系数（correlation coefficient），表示预测数据与实验数据之间的线性关系","symbol":"R","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"实验（testing）的实验数据","symbol":"M_i","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"由模型得到的相应预测数据","symbol":"N_i","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"M_i 的平均值","symbol":"\\overline{M}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"N_i 的平均值","symbol":"\\overline{N}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"测试数据的数量","symbol":"n","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"求和指标（从 1 到 n 遍历）","symbol":"i","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":[]}